{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311100","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1631110001:1":{"text":"하지만 “걸어”두어야 해. 소리로 목을 막지 마. 그러면 아주 힘들어질 테니까.","source_cn":"不过我们现在要把它“挂”起来，别把声音堵在喉咙里，那样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F21D5BFED4555E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631110002:0":{"text":"이, 이해가 잘 안돼요.","source_cn":"我……我不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64FDBDEE13D08264","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631110003:1":{"text":"하하, 하품하는 느낌을 한번 떠올려 보겠어?","source_cn":"呵呵，你可以尝试一下打哈欠的感觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD1CA2F9EE2EE76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631110004:1":{"text":"하암...","source_cn":"哈啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BB19A61862BE1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631110005:1":{"text":"그래, 입안이 열리고 연구개가 올라가는 느낌이 들지? 그 느낌을 유지한 채로 다시 해봐.","source_cn":"对，感受一下那个口腔内部打开、软腭抬起来的感觉了吗？用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C0A5C1710D73B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat